      "id": 201187,
      "name": "Eric R",
      "username": "Eric_R",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/b9bd4f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-08-04T04:07:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<blockquote><p><span>&nbsp;It would be a matter of seeing the languages of the type of islanders Dahan represent, and see if we can amalgamate these into some sort of coherent language.</span></p></blockquote><p>Er, um. I'm afraid the phonology was specifically devised to not localize the Dahan to any specific part of the world, as I was trying to make \"the type of islanders Dahan represent\" as broad as reasonably possible. So such a project would end up being even <em>more</em>&nbsp;ambitious than it sounds.&nbsp;^_^;</p><p>But I'm <em>really</em> happy that you're interested enough in them to float the idea!</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:29:39.053Z",
