      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<blockquote><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, HelveticaNeue, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;It would be a matter of seeing the languages of the type of islanders Dahan represent, and see if we can amalgamate these into some sort of coherent language.</span></p></blockquote><p>Er, um. I&#39;m afraid the phonology was specifically devised to not localize the Dahan to any specific part of the world, as I was trying to make &quot;the type of islanders Dahan represent&quot; as broad as reasonably possible. So such a project would end up being even <em>more</em>&nbsp;ambitious than it sounds.&nbsp;^_^;</p><p>But I&#39;m <em>really</em> happy that you&#39;re interested enough in them to float the idea!</p>",
